    <p class="note">Archive sizes of the v0.7.1 release assets. Linux builds need glibc 2.28 or newer; on Alpine, use npx.</p>
    <ul class="bin-trust">
      <li>install.sh and install.ps1 check each archive against SHA256SUMS and stop on a mismatch.</li>
