  <section class="sec start" aria-labelledby="start-title">
    <h2 id="start-title">Start from the README</h2>
    <pre><code>import { DatabaseSync } from 'node:sqlite';
import { createBot, initTelegramTables } from '@ghostpaw/telegram';

const db = new DatabaseSync('bot.db');
initTelegramTables(db);

const bot = createBot({
  token: process.env.TELEGRAM_TOKEN,
  db,
  onMessage: async ({ message, user }) =&gt; {
    console.log(user?.firstName, message.text);
  },
});

await bot.start(); // long-polling</code></pre>
    <p>To give an agent the mirror as an MCP server, add <code>ghostpaw-telegram mcp</code> to your client (or <code>npx -y @ghostpaw/telegram mcp</code> under Node.js 24).</p>
